  "name": "A Lesser Shadowhound's Houndmaster's Call hit is 0.3 of the Shadowhound's",
  "contract": [
    "In live raid logs from 2026-08-27 and 2026-08-31 (three Witch Hunters, eight fights) a Lesser Shadowhound's",
    "non-crit Houndmaster's Call (706332) hit is 0.27-0.31 of the permanent Shadowhound's in the same fight, and",
    "the permanent hound also has Lethal Pursuit's 10%, so lesser hounds land 0.3 of the Call value. Both hounds",
    "hit the same target, so armor and target modifiers cancel. The averages are compared through a chain: the",
    "Shadowhound's total over the lesser hound's average hit is its hit count times 1 / R, and its hit count over",
    "that is R. Expected: R within 0.27-0.33. Without the reduction R is 1."
